{"seq":2,"slug":"database-design-sql","title":"数据库设计与 SQL","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/programming-database/database-design-sql","wordCount":1247,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据库设计与-sql\">数据库设计与 SQL</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>几乎所有信息系统的背后都有一个数据库在运转——网上购物的订单记录、学校的学生信息、医院的就诊档案、企业的财务数据，都存储在数据库中。掌握关系数据库的设计方法和 SQL 查询语言，是从&quot;数据使用者&quot;进阶为&quot;系统搭建者&quot;的关键一步。</p>\n<h3 id=\"关系数据库核心概念\">关系数据库核心概念</h3><p><strong>数据库（Database）</strong>：有组织地存储和管理数据的仓库。</p>\n<p><strong>表（Table）</strong>：数据库中的核心对象，以行和列的二维结构存储数据。每行是一条记录（Record），每列是一个字段（Field）。</p>\n<p><strong>关键术语</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主键（Primary Key）</td>\n<td>唯一标识一条记录的字段</td>\n<td>学号、身份证号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外键（Foreign Key）</td>\n<td>指向另一张表主键的引用</td>\n<td>选课表中的学号引用学生表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引（Index）</td>\n<td>加速查询的数据结构</td>\n<td>给&quot;姓名&quot;字段建索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束（Constraint）</td>\n<td>保证数据完整性的规则</td>\n<td>NOT NULL, UNIQUE, CHECK</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>表之间的关系</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"erDiagram\" data-source=\"erDiagram&#10;    STUDENT ||--o{ ENROLLMENT : &quot;选课&quot;&#10;    COURSE ||--o{ ENROLLMENT : &quot;被选&quot;&#10;    STUDENT {&#10;        int student_id PK&#10;        string name&#10;        string class&#10;        date birth_date&#10;    }&#10;    COURSE {&#10;        int course_id PK&#10;        string course_name&#10;        int credit&#10;        string teacher&#10;    }&#10;    ENROLLMENT {&#10;        int id PK&#10;        int student_id FK&#10;        int course_id FK&#10;        float score&#10;    }\">erDiagram\n    STUDENT ||--o{ ENROLLMENT : \"选课\"\n    COURSE ||--o{ ENROLLMENT : \"被选\"\n    STUDENT {\n        int student_id PK\n        string name\n        string class\n        date birth_date\n    }\n    COURSE {\n        int course_id PK\n        string course_name\n        int credit\n        string teacher\n    }\n    ENROLLMENT {\n        int id PK\n        int student_id FK\n        int course_id FK\n        float score\n    }</pre><h3 id=\"mysql-安装与管理\">MySQL 安装与管理</h3><p><strong>安装方式推荐</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Windows：下载 MySQL Installer，选择 Developer Default 安装（含服务器 + Workbench 图形化工具）</li>\n<li>设置 root 密码（实训环境可用简单密码，生产环境必须强密码）</li>\n<li>确认服务自动启动：<code>services.msc</code> 中检查 MySQL 服务状态</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>图形化管理工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL Workbench（官方，功能全面）</li>\n<li>Navicat（第三方，界面友好，支持多种数据库）</li>\n<li>DBeaver（免费开源，支持几乎所有数据库）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>命令行连接</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"mysql -u root -p&#10;-- 输入密码后进入 MySQL 命令行\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mysql </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 输入密码后进入 MySQL 命令行</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"sql-增删改查-crud\">SQL 增删改查（CRUD）</h3><p><strong>创建数据库和表</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE DATABASE school_db CHARACTER SET utf8mb4;&#10;USE school_db;&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE students (&#10;    student_id INT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,&#10;    name VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,&#10;    gender ENUM(&#39;男&#39;, &#39;女&#39;) NOT NULL,&#10;    class VARCHAR(30),&#10;    enrollment_date DATE,&#10;    phone VARCHAR(11)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATABASE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> school_db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHARACTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> utf8mb4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> school_db;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> students</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    student_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AUTO_INCREMENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    gender ENUM(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'男'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'女'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    class </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    enrollment_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    phone </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">11</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>插入数据（INSERT）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"INSERT INTO students (name, gender, class, enrollment_date, phone)&#10;VALUES (&#39;张三&#39;, &#39;男&#39;, &#39;计算机1班&#39;, &#39;2024-09-01&#39;, &#39;13800138001&#39;);&#10;&#10;-- 批量插入&#10;INSERT INTO students (name, gender, class, enrollment_date, phone) VALUES&#10;(&#39;李四&#39;, &#39;女&#39;, &#39;计算机1班&#39;, &#39;2024-09-01&#39;, &#39;13800138002&#39;),&#10;(&#39;王五&#39;, &#39;男&#39;, &#39;计算机2班&#39;, &#39;2024-09-01&#39;, &#39;13800138003&#39;),&#10;(&#39;赵六&#39;, &#39;女&#39;, &#39;计算机2班&#39;, &#39;2024-09-01&#39;, &#39;13800138004&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gender, class, enrollment_date, phone)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'张三'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'男'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'计算机1班'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-09-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'13800138001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 批量插入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, gender, class, enrollment_date, phone) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'李四'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'女'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'计算机1班'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-09-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'13800138002'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'王五'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'男'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'计算机2班'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-09-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'13800138003'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'赵六'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'女'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'计算机2班'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-09-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'13800138004'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>查询数据（SELECT）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 查询所有学生&#10;SELECT * FROM students;&#10;&#10;-- 条件查询&#10;SELECT name, class FROM students WHERE gender = &#39;女&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 模糊查询&#10;SELECT * FROM students WHERE name LIKE &#39;张%&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 排序&#10;SELECT * FROM students ORDER BY enrollment_date DESC;&#10;&#10;-- 聚合函数&#10;SELECT class, COUNT(*) AS 人数 FROM students GROUP BY class;&#10;&#10;-- 多表联查（查询学生选课及成绩）&#10;SELECT s.name, c.course_name, e.score&#10;FROM students s&#10;JOIN enrollment e ON s.student_id = e.student_id&#10;JOIN courses c ON e.course_id = c.course_id&#10;WHERE e.score &gt;= 60&#10;ORDER BY e.score DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询所有学生</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 条件查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, class </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gender </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '女'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 模糊查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '张%'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> enrollment_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 聚合函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> class, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 人数 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> class;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 多表联查（查询学生选课及成绩）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">course_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> enrollment e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">student_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">student_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> courses c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">course_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">course_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>更新数据（UPDATE）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 修改单条记录&#10;UPDATE students SET phone = &#39;13900139001&#39; WHERE student_id = 1;&#10;&#10;-- 批量更新&#10;UPDATE students SET class = &#39;计算机3班&#39; WHERE class = &#39;计算机2班&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 修改单条记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> phone </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '13900139001'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> student_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 批量更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> class </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '计算机3班'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> class </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '计算机2班'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>删除数据（DELETE）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 删除特定记录（务必带 WHERE 条件！）&#10;DELETE FROM students WHERE student_id = 4;&#10;&#10;-- 清空表（保留表结构）&#10;TRUNCATE TABLE temp_data;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 删除特定记录（务必带 WHERE 条件！）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DELETE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> student_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 清空表（保留表结构）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TRUNCATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temp_data;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"表设计与规范化\">表设计与规范化</h3><p><strong>数据库设计三范式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>第一范式（1NF）</strong>：每个字段不可再分。如&quot;地址&quot;不应存储&quot;省+市+区&quot;的合并文本，应拆分为三个字段。</li>\n<li><strong>第二范式（2NF）</strong>：非主键字段完全依赖于主键（消除部分依赖）。</li>\n<li><strong>第三范式（3NF）</strong>：非主键字段不依赖于其他非主键字段（消除传递依赖）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实际设计建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>主键统一使用自增 INT（或 BIGINT）</li>\n<li>字段命名用小写下划线风格（<code>student_name</code> 而非 <code>StudentName</code>）</li>\n<li>日期字段用 DATE/DATETIME 类型，不用字符串存储</li>\n<li>金额字段用 DECIMAL(10,2)，不用 FLOAT（浮点精度问题）</li>\n<li>每张表添加 <code>created_at</code> 和 <code>updated_at</code> 时间戳字段</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"索引优化\">索引优化</h3><p>索引大幅提升查询速度，但也增加写入开销和存储空间。</p>\n<p><strong>索引使用原则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>WHERE 子句中频繁出现的字段建索引</li>\n<li>作为 JOIN 条件的外键字段建索引</li>\n<li>数据量小的表（&lt; 1000 行）不需要索引</li>\n<li>频繁更新的字段避免建索引</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 创建索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_student_name ON students(name);&#10;&#10;-- 查看执行计划（判断是否使用了索引）&#10;EXPLAIN SELECT * FROM students WHERE name = &#39;张三&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 创建索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_student_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看执行计划（判断是否使用了索引）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EXPLAIN </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> students </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '张三'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>查询性能的经验公式：无索引的全表扫描时间复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，B+Tree 索引查询为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——当表有 100 万行数据时，差距从遍历 100 万次缩减到约 20 次磁盘读取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026 年数据库领域的新趋势：云原生数据库（如阿里云 PolarDB、AWS Aurora）让中小企业无需自建服务器即可使用高性能数据库；AI 数据库助手可通过自然语言生成 SQL（如&quot;查询上月销售额前十的产品&quot;自动转为 SQL 语句）；NewSQL 数据库（TiDB、CockroachDB）兼顾了关系型的一致性和 NoSQL 的水平扩展能力；低代码平台让非开发人员也能通过拖拽创建数据库应用；向量数据库（Milvus、Pinecone）成为 AI 应用的标配存储。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>设计一个&quot;图书管理系统&quot;数据库：包含图书表、读者表、借阅记录表，定义主键、外键和必要约束，画出 ER 图并写出建表 SQL。</li>\n<li>在已有的学生表中，用一条 SQL 查询出&quot;计算机1班中成绩排名前 3 的学生姓名和分数&quot;。</li>\n<li>解释以下场景为什么违反了第三范式，并给出改进方案：订单表中同时存储了&quot;客户ID&quot;、&quot;客户姓名&quot;和&quot;客户电话&quot;。</li>\n<li>在一个 10 万行的表上，分别测试有索引和无索引时同一条 WHERE 查询的执行时间差异（使用 <code>EXPLAIN</code> 分析执行计划）。</li>\n<li>讨论：在什么情况下应该选择 NoSQL 数据库（如 MongoDB）而不是 MySQL？各自的典型应用场景是什么？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数据库是信息系统的数据基石。本节从概念模型（实体关系）到物理实现（建表语句），从基础 CRUD 到多表关联查询，从规范化设计到索引优化，构建了完整的数据库应用能力。SQL 语言的核心就是&quot;描述你想要什么数据&quot;——思路清晰比记住语法更重要。在实际工作中，大多数业务需求都可以通过灵活组合 SELECT + JOIN + WHERE + GROUP BY 来满足。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据库设计与 SQL","id":"数据库设计与-sql"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"关系数据库核心概念","id":"关系数据库核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"MySQL 安装与管理","id":"mysql-安装与管理"},{"level":3,"text":"SQL 增删改查（CRUD）","id":"sql-增删改查-crud"},{"level":3,"text":"表设计与规范化","id":"表设计与规范化"},{"level":3,"text":"索引优化","id":"索引优化"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"编程逻辑与 Python","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/programming-database/programming-logic-python"},"next":{"title":"Web 前端基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/programming-database/web-frontend-basics"}}